        <List2 Name="ILLines" />
        <Single Name="Comment" Type="string">
					(* System generated code, could be modified for your application *)
Controlling the first MainsContactor, bypassing the I_MainsContact1 digital input in case of virtual system without Drives
ErrorReaction[5] causes the contactor to open. ErrorReaction[5] is e.g. sent by the AxisModules in case of an inverter error.
(* End of system generated code, could be modified for your application *)
